1
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,534
You guys...

2
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:39,941
Have you handled them all?

3
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:43,796
Dad, why are you here?

4
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,650
Weren't you still ill?

5
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:51,941
I've come to protect you... in the way I never did before.

6
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:58,283
I'm sorry.

7
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:00,836
I misjudged the wrong person.

8
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,749
You didn't misjudge anyone.

9
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:06,996
You simply chose not to believe me.

10
00:01:07,810 --> 00:01:11,803
You drove Kaew out of the city without ever knowing the truth.

11
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:15,563
But a relationship like this... is not proper.

12
00:01:16,370 --> 00:01:18,829
If it's love, then what's wrong with it?

13
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:21,985
It's not the path you should be walking.

14
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:26,712
And the path you've chosen for me... is that truly my life?

15
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:56,785
Look out!!

16
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,450
You!!

17
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,476
Kaew!

18
00:02:11,534 --> 00:02:12,174
Kaew!

19
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,338
Kaew!

20
00:02:41,580 --> 00:02:42,370
Kaew!

21
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,538
Kaew, please don't die...

22
00:02:50,567 --> 00:02:52,894
please don't leave me.

23
00:02:54,230 --> 00:02:55,796
Please...

24
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:07,556
Don't cry.

25
00:03:11,003 --> 00:03:13,000
I'm going to lose you again.

26
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:27,200
I've never once regretted meeting you... my lady.

27
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:30,763
Neither have I.

28
00:06:35,774 --> 00:06:37,890
You gave my life meaning.

29
00:06:41,190 --> 00:06:46,269
You filled the emptiness that had always been in my heart.

30
00:06:47,410 --> 00:06:49,461
Don't say as if you're about to leave me.

31
00:06:58,050 --> 00:07:01,563
I love you, Lady Rinkham.

32
00:07:02,580 --> 00:07:04,101
I love you too.

33
00:07:04,138 --> 00:07:05,505
I love you with all my heart.

34
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:18,560
If there truly is another life…

35
00:07:21,930 --> 00:07:23,607
I pray that I'll be born to meet you again.

36
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:29,156
In a world where we are equals.

37
00:07:32,385 --> 00:07:34,380
In a place where we truly belong together...

38
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:37,396
where we are worthy of one another.

39
00:07:54,790 --> 00:07:58,821
Anywhere... as long as it's a place where we can love each other.

40
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:02,887
And stay together forever.

41
00:08:12,290 --> 00:08:13,272
Kaew...

42
00:08:14,590 --> 00:08:15,927
Kaew...

43
00:08:18,436 --> 00:08:19,949
Kaew...

44
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:31,425
Kaew...

45
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,258
Kaew...

46
00:08:51,980 --> 00:08:52,916
Kaew...
